Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade is a adventure,
action film directed by Steven Spielberg.

3
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:48,000
In 1938, an art collector appeals to eminent archaeologist Dr.

4
00:16:56,000 --> 00:17:02,000
Indiana Jones to embark on a search for the Holy Grail.

5
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Indy learns that a medieval historian has vanished while searching
for it, and the missing man is his own father, Dr.

6
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:30,000
Henry Jones Sr..

7
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:44,000
He sets out to rescue his father by following clues in the old man's
notebook, which his father had mailed to him before he went missing.

8
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:58,000
Indy arrives in Venice, where he enlists the help of a beautiful academic, Dr.

9
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:12,000
Elsa Schneider, along with Marcus Brody and Sallah.

10
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:26,000
Together they must stop the Nazis from recovering the power
of eternal life and taking over the world!

11
